<title>JAPAN: Bridgestone denies rumour of Pirelli unit purchase.</title>
<headline>Bridgestone denies rumour of Pirelli unit purchase.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bridgestone Corp on Tuesday denied a market rumour that it would buy Pirelli-Armstrong, Pirelli SpA's U.S. unit. &quot;I have not heard that we are buying the company,&quot; a spokesman for Bridgestone said.</p>
</text>
